WEBVTT

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:03.226
that's a chance
to rebalance opportunities.

00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:07.563
We give two beehives to women
and one to men.

00:02:07.587 --> 00:02:11.191
We also teach them about honey production,

00:02:11.215 --> 00:02:12.950
beeswax extraction,

00:02:12.974 --> 00:02:15.502
making honey wine and honey juice,

00:02:15.526 --> 00:02:19.250
and making detergents
and lotions out of beeswax.

00:02:19.274 --> 00:02:20.796
When they tend their hives,

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.357
the community keeps
an eye out for bushfires.

00:02:24.381 --> 00:02:29.786
And the income from bee farming
means they can plant more trees.

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:31.769
It's a powerful equation.